PHARMACOLOGICAL PROPERTIES
There are no known chemical incompatibilities to GONAL- F®.
Shelf-life
GONAL- F® is a preparation of follicle stimulating hormone produced by genetically engineered Chinese hamster ovary (CHO) cells.
The most important effect resulting from parenteral administration of FSH is the development of mature Graafian follicles.
The lyophilized product is stable for twelve months when stored at or below 25 °C, protected from light.
Special precautions for storage
Store at or below 25 °C, protected from light.
Following intravenous administration, GONAL- F® is distributed to the extracellular fluid space with an initial halflife around 2 hours and eliminated from the body with affter minal halflife of about one day.
The steady state volume of distribution and total clearance are 10 I and 0,6 l/h, respectively.
One-eighth of the GONAL- F® dose is excreted in the urine.
