HOW TO CONTACT THE EUROPEAN OMBUDSMAN ?
The European Ombudsman
QUESTIONS and ANSWERS
• By mail The European Ombudsman 1, avenue du Président Robert Schuman Β.P. 403 F - 67001 Strasbourg Cedex
• By telephone (33)3 88 17 40 01
Isabelle reception
