These are averages which conceal both operations exceeding these limits and the differences between Member States' performances.
The Commission itself mentions occasions when the copy 5 takes 10-12 months to return23.
In this context it is worth reproducing the table provided by the German authorities (by far the largest transit country) specifying the percentage of cases where the copy 5 returns within 6 weeks.
In general terms the overall impression is confirmed by the other Member States which provided a breakdown.
