ln such cases, in view of the fact that the onty admissibte amendments from the committee are those seeking to reach a compromise, and with a view to preseruing the sovereigntyof the House, the report referred to in Rule 60(2) mustclearty state which provisions already approved would falt if the proposed amendments were adopted.
