The declaration must now be followed up by real action as set out in specific instruments, realistic targets and effec tive timetables. The European Union must aim for greater coordination of employment policies and a growthorientated macroeconomic policy.
The Dutch presidency must follow on with specific measures on improving education, more relevant training, Community-based employment initiatives and giving priority to youth unemployment and life-long learning.
Taoiseach, you have mentioned the importance of training and education and the connection with drug-taking in cities such as Dublin. I appreciate that you actually understand the demands and needs of the ordinary people.
Again, I congratulate you and wish you well.
