Another positive factor is the pro liferation of regional agreements, which implies the emergence of awareness of a new and more appropriate methodological approach to development issues.
I believe that lack of information has been one of the main obstacles to full use of the funds. And, for this reason, too, it would be helpful if the Italian regions were to make themselves more visible within the Union, by opening agencies that could serve as information points for public and private bodies wishing to make use of these funds.
