At the European summit in Dublin a progress report was given on the fight against drags which named a number of specific focuses for action in 1997.
One of these was that a greater role should be given to research in the combating of drags. Research features prominently in the recently adopted Community action programme on prevention of drug dependence which is part of Community action in toe area of health.
