Patijn. - (NL) I agree with Mr Andersson's analysis, which draws a clear distinction between supply and demand. I think there is a large measure of consensus and
Debates of the European Parliament
At the same time I should point out to the honourable member that it is not the business of the CouncU to guarantee compliance with international treaties which toe Member States have signed in contexts other than that of toe European Union.
This is an individual responsibility incumbent on Member States, at least to the extent toat Community law is not involved.
The main objective is to suppress drugs, to counter international organized crime and in this respect Mr Andersson rightly calls for relations with third countries to be borne in mind.
We know toat the rapid processes of social change in some Eastern European countries have led to special risks in toe transportation and manufacture of hard drugs and I can assure you toat account is taken of this fact in toe Council's work.
I said just now that toe Dublin summit resolved to set up a group of senior representatives who will shortly come up with suggestions to counter organized crime; they will of course be examining large- and medium-scale drug trafficking and wiU make a point of looking closely at relations with third countries.
