I believe we can perfectly well debate this matter here in connection with toe question of toe mobile telephone service, because it is true, as Mrs Read said, toat this is going to become one market, and the Commission's strategy and tactics of splitting it up into smaUer and smaller sectors for technical reasons and regulating them in different ways carry less and less conviction.
