The Commission is actively encouraging the Advisory Group in this project, which ensures dialogue and transparency.
Fraga Estévez (PPE), Chairman of the Committee on Fisheries. - (ES) I have to tell this House that the Committee has decided to vote against this urgent procedure, that is it does not accept the urgency requested by the Council because it does not find that reasons put forward by the Council to be well founded.
