Aparicio Sánchez (PSE). - (ES) Mr President, I must devote the first few seconds of my speech to a matter unrelated to the Trakatellis report, but bound up with coUective ethics.
That is why I consider two amendments tabled by the Committee on the Environment, Public Health and Con sumer Protection most important.
Once concerns informa tion to the public.
