Secondly, it is particularly difficult in the case of the United Kingdom. Why is this?
We have all the problems which Mrs McCarthy has outlined.
The lack of partnership; I know this because I work in an Objective 2 area and I see these things happening.
There is a lack of partnership in many areas and almost complete lack of democracy on the programme monitoring committees.
We still have problems with additionality, added to which we have the problem that the British Government has re moved from local government every scrap of finance that can be used for matching funding.
