We have looked at both external and internal security, although less time has been devoted to internal security, important as it is.
We all know that people in the Member States are cunently very anxious about national security, but because it is to be specifically dealt with at the IGC and there is some talk óf a separate pillar being created for it in future, we thought we should concentrate on external security for the time being.
What can we in the House say about this?
