We need decisive action now by Euro pean Member States before it is too late.
Areitio Toledo (PPE), draftsman of the opinion of the Committee on Economic and Monetary Affairs and Industrial Policy. - (ES) Mr President, I would first like to congratulate the Commission on this initiative, because we believe it has really cooperated as an institution to identify and put on the table a highly important and sensitive issue for the economy, and not just the Union economy.
