- has recently adopted provisions aimed at limiting goods traffic on Sundays and public holidays.
Patijn. - (NL) I think the honourable Member is right in referring to the political and economic importance of the Cohesion Fund.
Camisón Asensio (PPE). - (ES) Mr President-in-Office of the Council, I am glad you broadly share our concern about this.
This is true of France, amongst others, which may damage certain countries with this ban. in particular it will be prejudicial to the transit of Spanish goods.
