I refer to Amendment No 1486 to the socalled 'Libertad' law adopted by the US Congress's Committee on Foreign Affairs on 6 May, following the agreement reached between Clinton's representatives and Leon Brittan.
The EU has suspended the WTO proceedings because it was afraid of winning.
Well, where do we actually stand now?
