Swoboda (PSE). - (DE) Mr President if I may make a brief remark on the previous debate, let me say that the Commission will probably also have to consider, if it is afraid of losing or actually does lose everything in the WTO, whether the balance of forces between America and Europe in the framework of the WTO is actually conect But that is just a remark on the previous debate.
