Of course the question of an energy tax concerns future technological development and it is also significant that the anthropogenic greenhouse effect was excluded.
Papoutsis, Member of the Commission. - (EL) Mr President the proposal we are considering is particularly important because it aims to improve cooperation between the Member States in matters related to energy policy.
