The text, and indeed the overall situation in the negotiations, were discussed in advance at an informal meeting of the group of personal representatives which was held in Houthem near Maastricht on 16 and 17 May.
Representatives of the European Parliament also attended much of the meeting.
On Tuesday, 20 May the Ministers of Foreign Affairs met to discuss the subject, and I was delighted that you too were able to attend and put forward your ideas.
