It is up to the market operator which system he chooses.
The directive does not therefore opt for either simulcrypt or multicrypt.
The common or combined use of conditional access systems means that a viewer, who initially subscribes to the services of one broadcaster, is subsequently able to use those of another supplier without having to acquire an other decoder.
That is the important point.
