We in this House are of the opinion that the solution must lie within the European Budget. The European Parliament's Committee on Budgets has again confirmed that very emphatically.
The European Parliament is ready to play its part in a process of creative thinking.
People like Mr Christodoulou have been involved in the negotiations, and he has aheady distinguished himself as the inventor of the negative reserve.
