Colom i Naval (PSE). - (ES) Madam President-in-Office, it would be a good thing if the Council were to turn to China in respect of the production of mines and their international trade.
Bertens (ELDR). - (NL) I should sincerely like to thank the Minister for her enthusiastic reply.
