It also makes it particularly urgent to undertake a thorough examination of the func­tioning of the PHARE programme as the most important instrument in this enlargement process.
As I said, we have taken the opportunity of the annual reports to undertake a more fundamental appraisal of the PHARE programme, a forward­looking appraisal.
