Broadly speaking, I agree with her and Mr Liese in their somewhat pessimistic assessments, but also on the positive aspects.
At the same time I recall that, when we had the Rio Conference back then, we were not particularly enthusiastic over the outcome either. We also said then that there were too many words and too little action.
