The Commission's justification that the countries in question may not be fully aware of the significance of their response for their industrial sector is unacceptable. I therefore support the rapporteur's move to incorporate the 'precautionary principle' into the Com mission proposal for a Council Regulation.
I can only regret, once again, the fact that the Commission refuses to regard the universal service as sufficiently important to be the subject of a Directive.
