Blot (NI), in writing. - (FR) Aid to hop producers is necessary.
The point is that the big American dealers exert a considerable influence on the world market situation. Since the market is not naturally balanced, producers do have to be granted aid.
Regrettably, that aid is much less than it needs to be in order to put up an adequate resistance to American pressure.
