Question No 36 by Anne Mcintosh (H-0509/97) Subject: Protection of animals at the time of slaughter
While Directive 93/119/EC (') lays down certain requirements for the protection of animals at the time of slaughter, Article 1 stipulates that 'this Directive shall not apply to animals which are killed in cultural or sports events'.
