There are certainly no grounds for complacency.
On top of that, we are forging ever closer relations with other parts of Asia, Relations with China are 'young' in the same way as the overall security relationship which Japan has with the United States.
For that country, we remain the fundamental anchor. That element is very often overlooked in Europe.
